(7496096, 1194367, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is really jumbled for a still life. Some suggestions I have:<br/>1. You really don''t need the money and receipt in there. That is taking away from the red.<br/>2. There are 8 products, a bowl, and a red cloth. That''s too much. Mayeb it''s just too much because they are tipped all over.<br/>3. The background is terrible, and give an amateur feel.</td>', 'This is really jumbled for a still life. Some suggestions I have:1. You really don''t need the money and receipt in there. That is taking away from the red.2. There are 8 products, a bowl, and a red cloth. That''s too much. Mayeb it''s just too much because they are tipped all over.3. The background is terrible, and give an amateur feel.', '2017-02-01 10:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496099, 1194675, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup. Decent light. Maybe a bit too yellow.<br/> <br/>Isn''t it odd how nice these look in person and how poor they look as a photo? I have tried this too, and I''m never happy with it.</td>', 'Nicely setup. Decent light. Maybe a bit too yellow. Isn''t it odd how nice these look in person and how poor they look as a photo? I have tried this too, and I''m never happy with it.', '2017-02-01 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
