(7496113, 1194572, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup. Classic still life style. Some suggestions I would have:<br/>1. The background chair is a little distracting. Did you try not having that?<br/>2. Seeing the side edges of the table doesn''t look great. Did you try a longer focal length to "crop" the scene tighter?<br/>3. Definitely get rid of the white milk carton cap.</td>', 'Nicely setup. Classic still life style. Some suggestions I would have:1. The background chair is a little distracting. Did you try not having that?2. Seeing the side edges of the table doesn''t look great. Did you try a longer focal length to "crop" the scene tighter?3. Definitely get rid of the white milk carton cap.', '2017-02-01 10:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496115, 1194681, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Well composed. Nice light.<br/>The stickers are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cool idea. Well composed. Nice light.The stickers are a bit distracting.', '2017-02-01 10:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
