(7496126, 1194195, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ha, great use of props. What makes this stand out against other photos with a lot of objects is that yours all go together nice. Clearly laid out with thoughts. Well lit.</td>', 'Ha, great use of props. What makes this stand out against other photos with a lot of objects is that yours all go together nice. Clearly laid out with thoughts. Well lit.', '2017-02-01 10:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
