(7496177, 1194117, 163430, '<td valign="top">I love this. It lacks almost everything a typical "technically well executed" photograph has. Focus, sharpness, contrast, blacks... It''s a grainy, blurry mess full of overblown highlights, but i still love it. Definitely in my top 5.<br/> <br/>Based on some recent forum activity, you''re gonna get slammed by some voters.</td>', 'I love this. It lacks almost everything a typical "technically well executed" photograph has. Focus, sharpness, contrast, blacks... It''s a grainy, blurry mess full of overblown highlights, but i still love it. Definitely in my top 5. Based on some recent forum activity, you''re gonna get slammed by some voters.', '2017-02-01 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496179, 1194662, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting storytelling. Very interesting indeed.<br/> <br/>Technically, i would prefer some more separation of the subjects from the background and a foreground that''s does not draw the attention to itself (referring to the wooden floor/table/countertop). But that''s just me.</td>', 'Interesting storytelling. Very interesting indeed. Technically, i would prefer some more separation of the subjects from the background and a foreground that''s does not draw the attention to itself (referring to the wooden floor/table/countertop). But that''s just me.', '2017-02-01 11:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
