(7497166, 1194383, 163430, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a snapshot taken in a supermarket. No story, no real idea behind it, with an inadequate photographic execution. The image is not straight, the camera angle is weird, the focus is nowhere to be found, the lighting is poor, the colors are off...<br/> <br/>I do commend the pun in the title.</td>', 'To me, this is a snapshot taken in a supermarket. No story, no real idea behind it, with an inadequate photographic execution. The image is not straight, the camera angle is weird, the focus is nowhere to be found, the lighting is poor, the colors are off... I do commend the pun in the title.', '2017-02-06 04:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497167, 1194367, 163430, '<td valign="top">The shot fits the challenge well, but the execution is not quite up to par.<br/>I do like the red concept but it''s still a messy red snapshot to me. Lighting is flat, the focus is undefined, the camera angle is weird...<br/>Minimal editing challenges do pose (ehem) challenge in all of these areas.</td>', 'The shot fits the challenge well, but the execution is not quite up to par.I do like the red concept but it''s still a messy red snapshot to me. Lighting is flat, the focus is undefined, the camera angle is weird...Minimal editing challenges do pose (ehem) challenge in all of these areas.', '2017-02-06 04:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497168, 1194608, 163430, '<td valign="top">This shot has lots of unused potential. If only you could have squeezed more contrast...</td>', 'This shot has lots of unused potential. If only you could have squeezed more contrast...', '2017-02-06 04:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497169, 1194358, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of the <b>supermarket</b> and the <b>still life</b> parts of the challenge, but...<br/> <br/>... the subject matter simply begs for color. Going with color might have backfired as well. The scene looks poorly lit, so high ISO was probably used. High ISO + color = nasty noise. Maybe the the lighting was too diverse in color and quality, which can also be an issue if you go color.<br/>... the image is not straight and it distracts me a lot.<br/>... the image lacks some overall sharpness.</td>', 'Nice combination of the supermarket and the still life parts of the challenge, but... ... the subject matter simply begs for color. Going with color might have backfired as well. The scene looks poorly lit, so high ISO was probably used. High ISO + color = nasty noise. Maybe the the lighting was too diverse in color and quality, which can also be an issue if you go color.... the image is not straight and it distracts me a lot.... the image lacks some overall sharpness.', '2017-02-06 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497172, 1194681, 163430, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean. Nice shot. Definitely in my top 5. maybe even in my top 3.<br/>The red apple is a nice touch. The whole shot works much better (to me), if it is placed closer to the top third.<br/> <br/><a href="https://flic.kr/p/QANRVW" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''https://c1.staticflickr.com/1/401/31899028844_36c5e35d72_m.jpg'', strrpos(''https://c1.staticflickr.com/1/401/31899028844_36c5e35d72_m.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://c1.staticflickr.com/1/401/31899028844_36c5e35d72_m.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Simple and clean. Nice shot. Definitely in my top 5. maybe even in my top 3.The red apple is a nice touch. The whole shot works much better (to me), if it is placed closer to the top third. ', '2017-02-06 04:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497174, 1194635, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice and cute. Solid photography work, too. It looks a bit tilted to the right, but, on the other hand, the jam label looks perfectly straight. So, it could be me, not the image.<br/>Personally, i would have swapped the two jars. Give the extremely shallow DoF, the PB is not recognizable in the back (unless you recognize the brand, which i don''t). I looks that, if swapped, the strawberries on the jam label would be recognizable enough.</td>', 'Nice and cute. Solid photography work, too. It looks a bit tilted to the right, but, on the other hand, the jam label looks perfectly straight. So, it could be me, not the image.Personally, i would have swapped the two jars. Give the extremely shallow DoF, the PB is not recognizable in the back (unless you recognize the brand, which i don''t). I looks that, if swapped, the strawberries on the jam label would be recognizable enough.', '2017-02-06 04:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497175, 1194007, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the subject. Solid photography work, too, but the main light needs a bit softening, IMO.</td>', 'Interesting take on the subject. Solid photography work, too, but the main light needs a bit softening, IMO.', '2017-02-06 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497178, 1194349, 80058, '<td valign="top">Has interest and nice complimentary colours</td>', 'Has interest and nice complimentary colours', '2017-02-06 05:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497179, 1194618, 80058, '<td valign="top">Interesting mood</td>', 'Interesting mood', '2017-02-06 05:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497181, 1194595, 80058, '<td valign="top">Very supermarket, very still life, love the colours and composition BUT dislike the harsh contrast on your image. Especially on the bottom left and left areas. Or is that just the colour of the apples? It brought it down for me</td>', 'Very supermarket, very still life, love the colours and composition BUT dislike the harsh contrast on your image. Especially on the bottom left and left areas. Or is that just the colour of the apples? It brought it down for me', '2017-02-06 05:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497183, 1194696, 80058, '<td valign="top">Though very supermarket, it lacks real narrative... too much going on. More is less!</td>', 'Though very supermarket, it lacks real narrative... too much going on. More is less!', '2017-02-06 05:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497185, 1194115, 80058, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge (I suppose) but lacks interest, maybe it needed some dramatic lighting to give a bit of oomph</td>', 'Meets the challenge (I suppose) but lacks interest, maybe it needed some dramatic lighting to give a bit of oomph', '2017-02-06 05:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497186, 1193889, 80058, '<td valign="top">You seem to have really though about the set up, but the composition and crop chosen is too tight. When I think of still life, I picture the entire subjects showing, it lacks negative space around it in my opinion</td>', 'You seem to have really though about the set up, but the composition and crop chosen is too tight. When I think of still life, I picture the entire subjects showing, it lacks negative space around it in my opinion', '2017-02-06 05:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497188, 1193942, 80058, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, I think the background gives a good sense of market. <br/> <br/>I like your range of subjects but perhaps try be more selective with them. Could you have peeled that bit of onion skin that''s coming off? Could the chives not be broken at the ends? Does the peanuts, between the chives add anything or makes it look messy? <br/> <br/> <br/>I would''ve given a 8 if it had those details looked into</td>', 'Meets the challenge, I think the background gives a good sense of market.  I like your range of subjects but perhaps try be more selective with them. Could you have peeled that bit of onion skin that''s coming off? Could the chives not be broken at the ends? Does the peanuts, between the chives add anything or makes it look messy?   I would''ve given a 8 if it had those details looked into', '2017-02-06 05:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497189, 1194195, 80058, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, bit bonkers with the choice of subject (which I like!) didn''t need the "Herb Ox" box in my opinion, unless you could clearly see the packaging. Interesting textures</td>', 'Meets the challenge, bit bonkers with the choice of subject (which I like!) didn''t need the "Herb Ox" box in my opinion, unless you could clearly see the packaging. Interesting textures', '2017-02-06 05:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497190, 1194589, 80058, '<td valign="top">Lacking drama or narrative for me. To improve, maybe re-think how your composition could add a point of interest? Do you think the background highlights are helping?</td>', 'Lacking drama or narrative for me. To improve, maybe re-think how your composition could add a point of interest? Do you think the background highlights are helping?', '2017-02-06 05:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497191, 1194367, 80058, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but lacks finesse for me. You started making an effort with the red cloth, then seemed to stop there.<br/>I reckon this would''ve been more effective in an entire red background!</td>', 'Meets the challenge but lacks finesse for me. You started making an effort with the red cloth, then seemed to stop there.I reckon this would''ve been more effective in an entire red background!', '2017-02-06 05:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497192, 1194410, 80058, '<td valign="top">I see there''s a bit of a Warhol influence here, I like the idea of that but perhaps could''ve used a brighter, crazier packaging to make this pop more.<br/> <br/>The photograph of the soup is not very pleasing imo</td>', 'I see there''s a bit of a Warhol influence here, I like the idea of that but perhaps could''ve used a brighter, crazier packaging to make this pop more. The photograph of the soup is not very pleasing imo', '2017-02-06 05:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497193, 1194649, 80058, '<td valign="top">I like the subject chosen, I think the composition could''ve been improved. I don''t think the "organic" signage is adding anything to this, nor is the over expose cabbage (?) on the top left corner? <br/> <br/>Could the saturation and contrast been boosted to make the lovely colours stand out more?</td>', 'I like the subject chosen, I think the composition could''ve been improved. I don''t think the "organic" signage is adding anything to this, nor is the over expose cabbage (?) on the top left corner?  Could the saturation and contrast been boosted to make the lovely colours stand out more?', '2017-02-06 05:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497194, 1193997, 80058, '<td valign="top">Lacks narrative  because there''s one too many products and therefore no real focus or story behind it? <br/>Less is more!</td>', 'Lacks narrative  because there''s one too many products and therefore no real focus or story behind it? Less is more!', '2017-02-06 05:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497195, 1194675, 80058, '<td valign="top">Though one to feedback. I love the growth coming out of the spuds, makes it a very peculiar subject matter. I think, that on it''s own, stacked weirdly and/or sculpturally, with a plain cloth would''ve been very effective! Very still life! Super interesting.<br/> <br/>You took that away for me, with the choice of background colours and textures</td>', 'Though one to feedback. I love the growth coming out of the spuds, makes it a very peculiar subject matter. I think, that on it''s own, stacked weirdly and/or sculpturally, with a plain cloth would''ve been very effective! Very still life! Super interesting. You took that away for me, with the choice of background colours and textures', '2017-02-06 05:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497196, 1194643, 80058, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I find it lacks real interest and attention to detail. I can see some brownies smudges on the lid. Could you have created an interesting pattern with the items or packaging? Could you have chose a more interesting packaging?</td>', 'Nice picture but I find it lacks real interest and attention to detail. I can see some brownies smudges on the lid. Could you have created an interesting pattern with the items or packaging? Could you have chose a more interesting packaging?', '2017-02-06 06:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497197, 1194083, 80058, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel like, you created that still life. I also find the crop a bit odd ( hard to be be thoughtful of that, since you can''t change it?)</td>', 'Doesn''t feel like, you created that still life. I also find the crop a bit odd ( hard to be be thoughtful of that, since you can''t change it?)', '2017-02-06 06:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497199, 1194572, 80058, '<td valign="top">Love a "Campbell" tin! It''s such an iconic piece of packaging that you could''ve created a very simple still life just using that, had it been more "Warhol" it''d be alot more effective. <br/> <br/>You made some effort with the set up, but it seems a bit odd to me. Could just be me, but I don''t tend to have milk nor carckers with my soup (I have bread/crutons/cheese but each to their own). Unless the image speaks, of odd eating habits. It makes me think you, just wanted to fill up the frame with what you had.<br/> <br/>There''s alot happening but not saying anything. Less is more!</td>', 'Love a "Campbell" tin! It''s such an iconic piece of packaging that you could''ve created a very simple still life just using that, had it been more "Warhol" it''d be alot more effective.  You made some effort with the set up, but it seems a bit odd to me. Could just be me, but I don''t tend to have milk nor carckers with my soup (I have bread/crutons/cheese but each to their own). Unless the image speaks, of odd eating habits. It makes me think you, just wanted to fill up the frame with what you had. There''s alot happening but not saying anything. Less is more!', '2017-02-06 06:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
